OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman who fixed Spitfires in
OL,4,AWorld War Two
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen pilots were losing power in World
OL,7,FWar Two at the worst possible moment, a
OL,8,Fmotorcycle racer and engineer who lived
OL,9,Fin Dorking came up with an ingenious
OL,10,Fsolution.
OL,12,FThe RAF's Spitfires and Hurricanes were
OL,13,Fpowered by the Rolls-Royce Merlin
OL,14,Fengine, but pilots faced a frustrating
OL,15,Fdisadvantage in combat.
OL,17,FWhile German Messerschmitt Bf 109
OL,18,Ffighters used fuel-injected engines and
OL,19,Fcould dive steeply away from danger,
OL,20,FBritish aircraft sometimes suffered
OL,21,Fengine failure during sudden
OL,22,Fmanoeuvres.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
