OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman who fixed Spitfires in
OL,4,AWorld War Two
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe culprit was the Merlin's
OL,7,Fcarburettor, but was tackled by
OL,8,FBeatrice "Tilly" Shilling, one of
OL,9,FBritain's pioneering female engineers.
